{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19083","headline":"送前进士蔡京赴学究科 · 刘禹锡","name":"送前进士蔡京赴学究科","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耳闻战鼓带经锄，振发声名自里闾。\n已是世间能赋客，更攻窻下绝编书。\n朱门达者谁能识，绦帐书生尽不如。\n幸遇天官旧丞相，知君无翼上空虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}